			<dc:description>
				<rdf:Alt>
					<rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Provides information about using, customizing, and simulating the DDR3 or DDR4 SDRAM, LPDDR3 SDRAM, QDR II+ SRAM,  QDR-IV SRAM, or a RLDRAM 3 interface core. It also describes the core architecture and provides details on customizing and interfacing to the core.</rdf:li>
